}, {"file_name": "Screen_3.png", "id": "26184940684490832", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491828050_26184940697824164_4863657603924781002_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zlT-cZfZIjsQ7kNvwHhuwXq&_nc_oc=Adq0CRhEhyaZLLbDsZUpTHeha2t7oO93aSq5kf_zXdQkcCx6D920SZ3-w2c592AWTaw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGvT6Rt8xY5vAEQ_IWIROdYH1azTDaKy0T-EEXsF7dcIA&oe=6A8C0FF9"}, {"file_name": "Screen_5.png", "id": "2071882106986195", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821081_2071882110319528_3620326011182710317_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=kgvLEqjHZW8Q7kNvwG--clN&_nc_oc=AdoDaY1M_VMjea-3gpeMZPSqrwHAdYqucnez_Ywsh-2_TnHsqRGe9T4uojnQdjWYpI4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQE9qrtABDlzlyQCEtiheTBt4ZNBKAHobEGpvhzj2oqjGQ&oe=6A8C471C"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Screen_1.png", "id": "1427290511740522", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819281_1427290518407188_8392266140913895164_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZRn_-BWZKB8Q7kNvwF2jqUZ&_nc_oc=AdqeZL63zpW7L6Ibkgzg04vtUsO0pmLc1hKV7lHdzZCOzQe3-iyReI8S17KH-vz8XJo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFVXmXLCt8KLkB3_TF5ArXIWbwBtTYxs8bPtagqHMeZKw&oe=6A8C2910"}, "display_name": "No Guns. Just Stuff.", "keywords": ["zombie", "apocalypsys", "shooter", "physics", "lowpoly"], "long_description": "Survive the Zombie Chaos in VR\n\nThe city has fallen. Zombies are everywhere. Your only chance to escape is to protect the engineer while he prepares the system that will get you out.\n\nBut there\u2019s one problem\u2026\n\nYou don\u2019t have guns.\n\nInstead, you must fight using whatever you can throw.\n\nGrab heavy boxes to knock zombies down.\nLaunch deadly spinning saw blades that slice enemies in half.\nTrigger massive explosions with fuel barrels to clear entire groups of undead.\n\nEvery throw is physical, fast, and satisfying in VR.\n\nAcross multiple missions you must hold your ground while the engineer works. Zombies will attack from every direction, forcing you to react quickly and use the environment to survive. If the engineer dies, the mission fails.\n\nThe longer you survive, the more intense the attacks become.\n\nUse timing, aim, and clever positioning to control the chaos.\n\nKey Features\n\n\u2022 Physics-based VR combat \u2013 throw objects to defeat zombies\n\u2022 Three deadly tools \u2013 boxes, spinning saw blades, and explosive fuel barrels\n\u2022 Protect the engineer while he completes critical tasks\n\u2022 Multiple missions with increasing difficulty\n\u2022 Fast arcade-style gameplay designed for VR\n\u2022 Clean low-poly visuals that keep the action clear and readable\n\nSurvive the missions.\nProtect the engineer.\nEscape the undead.", "short_description": "A chaotic low-poly VR zombie game where you survive by throwing deadly objects instead of using guns. Smash zombies with heavy boxes, slice them in half with spinning saw blades, and blow them away with explosive fuel barrels. Every encounter is fast, physical, and satisfying. Fight off waves of undead using timing, aim, and the environment in this arcade-style VR survival experience."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://halvrox.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Halvrox LLC", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://halvrox.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_FEW", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "3744040075834813"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "644354873106712"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memo